---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Community Baptist Church of West Covina is a loving church family in Baldwin Park, CA. Join us for Sunday worship, Bible study, and fellowship. All are welcome."
bodyClass: page-home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-rays" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-emblem-wrap">
      {% emblem "hero-emblem", "Gold cross with a white dove, the emblem of Community Baptist Church", "220px" %}
    </div>
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light hero-eyebrow">Welcome Home</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">{{ church.shortName }} <span>{{ church.subName }}</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">{{ church.tagline }}</p>
    <p class="hero-service">{% icon "calendar" %}<span>Join us this Sunday &middot; <strong>{{ church.mainService.label }} at {{ church.mainService.time }}</strong></span></p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href="/visit/">Plan Your Visit{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/staff/">{% icon "users" %}Meet Our Staff</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services-overlap" aria-labelledby="times-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="times-heading" class="visually-hidden">Service Times</h2>
    {% include "partials/service-cards.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tight" aria-labelledby="welcome-heading">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">You Belong Here</p>
      <h2 id="welcome-heading" class="section-title">A Church Family That Feels Like Home</h2>
      <p class="lead-dark">Community Baptist Church of West Covina is a place where families grow in faith, neighbors become friends, and everyone is greeted with a warm smile and an open heart.</p>
      <p>We are a Bible-believing Baptist congregation devoted to worship, prayer, fellowship, and service. Whether you have walked with the Lord your whole life or are just beginning your journey, there is a seat and a family waiting for you.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Learn more about our church{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </div>
    <aside class="pastor-feature reveal" aria-label="A word from our pastor">
      <p class="eyebrow">A Word From Our Pastor</p>
      <blockquote class="pastor-quote">
        <p>{{ church.pastor.welcome[1] }}</p>
      </blockquote>
      {% include "partials/pastor-card.njk" %}
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-ivory" aria-labelledby="expect-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your First Visit</p>
      <h2 id="expect-heading" class="section-title">What to Expect</h2>
      <p>Visiting a church for the first time can feel like a big step. Here is a little of what you will find when you join us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <span class="feature-icon">{% icon "smile" %}</span>
        <h3>A Warm Welcome</h3>
        <p>Friendly greeters will meet you at the door and help you find a seat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <span class="feature-icon">{% icon "music" %}</span>
        <h3>Spirit-Filled Worship</h3>
        <p>Hymns, gospel music, prayer, and a message from God's Word.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <span class="feature-icon">{% icon "shirt" %}</span>
        <h3>Come As You Are</h3>
        <p>Wear what makes you comfortable. God looks at the heart.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <span class="feature-icon">{% icon "accessibility" %}</span>
        <h3>Easy to Get Around</h3>
        <p>Our building is accessible, and someone is always glad to help.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="center reveal"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/visit/">Plan Your Visit{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="verse-band" aria-label="Scripture">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="verse-text">&ldquo;I was glad when they said unto me, Let us go into the house of the <span class="smallcaps">Lord</span>.&rdquo;</p>
    <cite class="verse-cite">Psalm 122:1</cite>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="ministries-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Serving Together</p>
      <h2 id="ministries-heading" class="section-title">Our Ministries</h2>
      <p>God has given each of us gifts to serve one another. There is a place for you to belong and to serve.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ministry-grid">
      {%- for m in ministries %}
      <a class="ministry-card reveal" href="/ministries/#{{ m.name | slugify }}">
        <span class="ministry-icon">{% icon m.icon %}</span>
        <h3>{{ m.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ m.summary }}</p>
        <span class="card-more">Learn more{% icon "arrow-right" %}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="cta-band-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container cta-band-inner reveal">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Our Leadership</p>
      <h2 class="cta-band-title">Meet Our Pastor &amp; Staff</h2>
      <p class="cta-band-text">Get to know the faithful servants who shepherd, teach, and care for our church family.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row btn-row-left">
      <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href="/staff/">{% icon "users" %}Meet Our Staff</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-label="Location and directions">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/map-block.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
